kubectl apply -f nginx-deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f nginx-service.yaml

Access the Service
----------------------------------------
Find the external IP of a worker node:
kubectl get nodes -o wide
If your worker node’s IP is 192.168.1.100, you can access Nginx from outside the cluster using:
http://192.168.1.100:30080


----------------------------------------
Summary
Nginx Deployment: 3 replicas running inside the cluster
NodePort Service: Exposes Nginx on port 30080 on all nodes
External Access: http://<NODE_IP>:30080


